function pathForPage(page,slug){if(page==='firm-profile'){const s=slug||currentProfileSlug||'';return s?`/firm/${s}`:'/'}if(page==='home')return '/';if(page==='partner-badges'||page==='widgets')return '/widgets';if(page==='payout-detail')return '/payouts';return `/${page}`}
